{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 18, :comments ["<b>And the nazirite shall shave.</b> From what is stated above — 'a razor shall not pass over his head' — we learn that this shaving is with a razor." "<b>And he shall place it on the fire.</b> Since it is holy, as it is stated above — 'holy he shall be, the growth of the hair of his head shall grow long' — therefore it is fit to burn it, lest people stumble through it." "<b>Which is under the sacrifice of the shelamim.</b> Since it is holy, it requires being burned under the pot in which the shelamim are cooked."], :book :numbers, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 6, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:16:44.334093948Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}